 <LayoutItem background="false" blendMode="0" excludeFromExports="0" frame="false" frameJoinStyle="miter" groupUuid="" halign="1" htmlState="0" id="" itemRotation="0" labelText="Each lake has at most one printed time range:&#xa;the longest modeled landing-to-landing crossing.&#xa;Its exact endpoint pair is recorded in the layer&#xa;and the table below. Shorter crossings may take&#xa;less time. An unnumbered lake has no modeled&#xa;crossing. All alternatives remain in the register.&#xa;&#xa;Bent carries echo recorded trail geometry. Small&#xa;IDs identify them; rods are kept in the CSV.&#xa;No inference should be made from an absent link.&#xa;&#xa;Landmark leaders associate a feature with a lake,&#xa;not a measured sight line. Water-visible features&#xa;have published lake-view evidence. (walk) marks&#xa;waterfalls reached on foot, not a canoe sighting.&#xa;&#xa;Landmark coordinates and viewing descriptions&#xa;are in the geographic project and LANDMARKS.md.&#xa;Generic DEM summit candidates are hidden there;&#xa;they are not shown as visible landmarks here." marginX="0" marginY="0" opacity="1" outlineWidthM="0.3,mm" position="277,59,mm" positionLock="false" positionOnPage="277,59,mm" referencePoint="0" size="139,116,mm" templateUuid="{6f39c0cf-ca0e-4759-b634-d5c3dfaeb618}" type="65641" uuid="{6f39c0cf-ca0e-4759-b634-d5c3dfaeb618}" valign="32" visibility="1" zValue="16">
